* To compile llvm 3.7 on osx:

    * extract llvm sourcecode
    * extract clang (cfe) sourcecode into llvm-3.7/tools, rename directory to clang
    * extract compiler-rt into llvm-3.7/projects, rename directory to compiler-rt
    * extract lld to llvm-3.7/tools, rename to lld
    * Run cmake with -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=X86
    * Run make -j8

* Not tested: lld <-- experimental, please use a cross-binutils for i586-elf
* Check test for example usage




